# Run D (user 2026-11-06, "Lets try IQL"): run A's settings (online freeze 1000,
# encoder + GRU frozen) with the learner switched from SAC to IQL -- one change
# from il_finetune_c0_trunk.env (job 463479).
#
# Four SAC fine-tunes collapsed once the clone's actor could move (online freeze,
# 50/50 replay, frozen encoder, temperature 0.001 all failed): SAC's actor climbs
# the critic at sampled actions and its target bootstraps from the policy's next
# action, where the narrow data never was. IQL queries the critic only at replay
# actions: V = expectile 0.7 of Q_targ(s, a_replay), Q -> r + gamma V(s'), actor =
# advantage-weighted regression, w = exp(3 A / Q-std) clipped at 100
# (torch_rl/iql.py). The offline critic warm-up is IQL's offline phase on the
# expert data; the cloning term is as in the other runs.
. "$REPO/slurm/il_finetune_c0_trunk.env"
export ALGO=iql IQL_EXPECTILE=0.7 IQL_BETA=3.0 IQL_MAX_WEIGHT=100
